title: "HackMatch — US-004: Email-Based Login Two-Factor Authentication — MFA Challenge State Diagram"
---
%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"background":"#ffffff","primaryColor":"#e8f1ff","primaryTextColor":"#1f2937","primaryBorderColor":"#3b82f6","lineColor":"#4b5563","secondaryColor":"#f3e8ff","tertiaryColor":"#fff7d6","fontFamily":"Arial, sans-serif"},"flowchart":{"useMaxWidth":true,"htmlLabels":true,"curve":"basis","nodeSpacing":38,"rankSpacing":50,"padding":14}}}%%
flowchart TB
    NONE["No active challenge<br/>Primary authentication remains pre-MFA"]:::identity
    PENDING["Pending challenge<br/>Participant-bound hash verifier<br/>Expires 10 minutes after creation"]:::transition
    FAIL["Failed attempt recorded<br/>Account-wide consecutive count retained"]:::warning
    CONSUMED["Consumed<br/>Exactly one valid concurrent request wins"]:::success
    INVALIDATED["Invalidated<br/>Cannot authenticate"]:::denied
    EXPIRED["Expired<br/>Rejected at or after expires_at"]:::denied
    LOCKED["Account locked for 15 minutes<br/>Outstanding challenges invalidated<br/>New challenge/session renewal denied"]:::danger
    LOCKEND["Lock expired<br/>Failure cycle may restart"]:::transition
    CLAIM["Current sign-in MFA claim set<br/>mfa_auth_time equals auth_time"]:::success
    GAP["Current browser-path gap<br/>Fresh primary auth after lock expiry is not<br/>checked by /mfa/challenge + {code}"]:::warning
    STORE["Persistence detail<br/>mfa_challenges stores state;<br/>mfa_attempts derives failure cycle and lock"]:::internal

    NONE -->|Eligible password/OAuth sign-in and successful delivery| PENDING
    PENDING -->|Correct 6-digit code before expiry<br/>atomic compare-and-set| CONSUMED
    CONSUMED --> CLAIM
    PENDING -->|Incorrect code| FAIL
    FAIL -->|Failures 1 through 4| PENDING
    FAIL -->|Fifth consecutive failure| LOCKED
    LOCKED --> INVALIDATED
    LOCKED -->|15 minutes elapse| LOCKEND
    LOCKEND -->|Required design: fresh primary auth + new OTP| NONE
    PENDING -->|Resend creates replacement| INVALIDATED
    INVALIDATED -->|Replacement delivered, failures unchanged| PENDING
    PENDING -->|Email delivery fails| INVALIDATED
    PENDING -->|Time reaches expiry| EXPIRED
    EXPIRED -->|Fresh challenge requested| NONE
    GAP -.-> LOCKEND
    STORE -.-> PENDING
    STORE -.-> FAIL

